# Rocha Cotizador

B2B wholesale quoter (embutidos, panadería, varios). Single-tenant. UI brand: **Rocha Cotizador**.

## Stack

Next.js 16 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind 4, Prisma 6 + PostgreSQL, NextAuth v5 (Credentials), Zustand, Zod.

## Auth / pricing

| Role | Login | Routes |
|------|-------|--------|
| `CUSTOMER` | 3-digit code + password (initial PIN 4 digits; change recommended, not required) | `/cotizar`, `/remitos`, `/cuenta` |
| `ADMIN` | Email + password | `/admin/*` |

Customer prices = fixed list (`Customer.priceListId` → `PriceListItem.unitPrice`). Base = `PriceList.isBase` (excelKey `"5"`, sync `Product.basePrice`); null `priceListId` → base. Client APIs never expose list metadata — only resolved `unitPrice` (`src/lib/pricing.ts`, `src/lib/price-list-resolve.ts`).

## Key paths

- Schema/seed: `prisma/schema.prisma`, `prisma/seed.ts`, `prisma/data/rocha_data.xlsx` (binary ignored by `.cursorignore`)
- Auth: `src/lib/auth.ts`, `src/lib/session.ts`
- Quote UI: `src/components/quote/quote-builder.tsx`
- Remito: `src/app/remitos/[number]/page.tsx`
- Admin: `src/app/admin/(protected)/`

## Conventions

- New branch from `development` per task — `git-workflow.mdc`
- Minimal diffs; no drive-by refactors
- Seed PINs: `prisma/data/seed-pins.csv` (gitignored + cursorignored)
